# Optional HTTPS origin override; Vercel works without it.
# SITE_URL=https://setupkelly.vercel.app
# Local development defaults to http://localhost:3000.
# Forms: leave both unset to keep the local mock (nothing is sent or saved).
# Set both in Vercel (Production) to send leads to Kelly's Google Sheet via Apps Script.
# See integrations/google-apps-script/README.md. Never commit real values.
# LEADS_ENDPOINT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/<deployment-id>/exec
# LEADS_ENDPOINT_TOKEN=<random string, 24+ characters, same as LEADS_TOKEN in the script>
